<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78986" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραυδάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>console, encourage</i> (<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύθοις ἀγανοῖσι παραυδήσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.53
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειλιχίοις ἐπέεσσι παραυδῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					16.279
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				5.261
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ ταῦτα παραύδα, χρῶτ᾽
				ἀπονίπτεσθαι</span>
			<i>do</i> not <i>coax</i> me thus, to wash, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				18.178
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc. rei,
				<i>speak lightly of, make light of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ δή μοι θάνατόν γε παραύδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.488
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
